{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Warmth Between Us",
    "steam_appid": 1203970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203970/extras/title.JPG?t=1647439256\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Background</h2>It is late December in Taipei.  <br><br>The pavement glows like silver under the bone-chilling winter rain.<br>With the coming of the New Year, we met for the first time.<br><br>Our beginning was nothing special.  It was ordinary, yet, so unaccounted for.<br>However, I couldn\u2019t help but let myself drown in this warm but distant vibe.<br><br>Her shadow, her every move and sensation piques my curiosity.<br>The warmth between us has a certain comfort that I\u2019ve never felt before\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About The Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A visual novel containing 60,000 words, with 6 hours of gameplay.<br></li><li>10+ beautifully-illustrated CG artwork</li></ul><br>This is a story about the warmth between people.<br>It was a simple act that brought us together but became a life-defining moment, affecting the choices we make.<br><br>Our relationship cannot be described as friendship or love.  Rather, it is built upon the support and warmth we share with each other.<br><br>It is...a simple act of intuition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From the Developer</h2>Hi, I\u2019m Nine, an indie game developer from Taiwan.<br>I\u2019m slowly but steadily realizing my dream by creating more and more stories.<br><br>Along the way, there have been many obstacles,<br>and I\u2019ve become confused by the road ahead of me.<br><br>However, that is why I can feel the warmth radiating from the people who have supported and helped me along the way.<br><br>That\u2019s why I want to share these emotions with everyone.<br><br>I will continue to create more stories about \u2018warmth\u2019.<br>I hope that they can resonate with you.<br><br>If I\u2019m able to do so, then I have fulfilled my purpose.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1203970/extras/title.JPG?t=1647439256\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Background</h2>It is late December in Taipei.  <br><br>The pavement glows like silver under the bone-chilling winter rain.<br>With the coming of the New Year, we met for the first time.<br><br>Our beginning was nothing special.  It was ordinary, yet, so unaccounted for.<br>However, I couldn\u2019t help but let myself drown in this warm but distant vibe.<br><br>Her shadow, her every move and sensation piques my curiosity.<br>The warmth between us has a certain comfort that I\u2019ve never felt before\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About The Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A visual novel containing 60,000 words, with 6 hours of gameplay.<br></li><li>10+ beautifully-illustrated CG artwork</li></ul><br>This is a story about the warmth between people.<br>It was a simple act that brought us together but became a life-defining moment, affecting the choices we make.<br><br>Our relationship cannot be described as friendship or love.  Rather, it is built upon the support and warmth we share with each other.<br><br>It is...a simple act of intuition.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From the Developer</h2>Hi, I\u2019m Nine, an indie game developer from Taiwan.<br>I\u2019m slowly but steadily realizing my dream by creating more and more stories.<br><br>Along the way, there have been many obstacles,<br>and I\u2019ve become confused by the road ahead of me.<br><br>However, that is why I can feel the warmth radiating from the people who have supported and helped me along the way.<br><br>That\u2019s why I want to share these emotions with everyone.<br><br>I will continue to create more stories about \u2018warmth\u2019.<br>I hope that they can resonate with you.<br><br>If I\u2019m able to do so, then I have fulfilled my purpose.",
